00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.800
Yes!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.320
You are an alien.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:41.490
You must return to your home planet.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.710
I, Otonashi Yukari, will get Miss Shigyo's stone as soon as possible!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.470
Hey, no trespassers!

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.140
Don't move!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:48.930
Wait.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.890
