00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:08.490
Where is the eighth one hidden?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.410
I-I don't know.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.120
What country are you all from?

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.040
I am the president's daughter.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:24.050
If you harm me, it will become an international problem.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.800
Are you okay with that?

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.430
That's perfect. Bring her with us.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.430
Huh?

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.350
W-Wait!

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:16.230
Even if we have been forsaken by the country,

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:21.400
we cannot give the license to those without the heart of chivalry.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:29.700
Thanks!

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:34.080
Where am I?

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:38.500
There aren't... any landmarks...

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:43.840
An alien...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:16.410
Thou shalt not pass

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:21.790
Laws, reason, nobody is getting past

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:27.630
I don't care what you say

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:33.090
I'm not letting friends and lovers in either

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:37.220
My only companion

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:42.980
is the faint moonlight

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:54.910
I'm now sitting in the cockpit

00:23:55.160 --> 00:24:01.160
